      "areatype": "",
      "name": "Coruscant Galactic Academy - Grand Atrium",
      "desc": "Sunlight pours through towering transparisteel windows into the Grand Atrium of\nthe Coruscant Galactic Academy. Students and instructors from across the galaxy\nmove between halls leading to classrooms, simulators, and training facilities.\nHolographic directories hover above the polished floor, guiding newcomers to\ntheir destinations. The air hums with anticipation as every journey begins\nwithin these walls.",
